OL,3,AAustralians will be able to switch off
OL,4,Asocial media algorithms under planned
OL,5,Alegislation
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralians would be able to switch off
OL,8,Fsocial media algorithms under draft
OL,9,Flegislation to be proposed this week.
OL,11,FCommunications Minister Anika Wells,
OL,12,Fwho last year helmed the government's
OL,13,Fworld-first social media ban for
OL,14,Funder-16s, said the digital duty of
OL,15,Fcare laws would ensure "some basic
OL,16,Fsafety protections on an industry that
OL,17,Fhasn't had to observe it".
OL,19,FIf tech firms such as Meta, Google and
OL,20,FTikTok did not give the option to turn
OL,21,Foff algorithms, they should face
OL,22,F"substantial" penalties, she said.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
