OL,3,AAustralians will be able to switch off
OL,4,Asocial media algorithms under planned
OL,5,Alegislation
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome members of the opposition have
OL,8,Fcriticised the proposal, with Liberal
OL,9,FParty leader Angus Taylor saying he was
OL,10,F"highly sceptical" and arguing the move
OL,11,Fcould amount to censorship.
